[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19157.51, "timestamp": "05:19:17", "text": "我們把花放進"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19159.75, "timestamp": "05:19:19", "text": "去。我的天啊。  熨燙切割。我不知道這是從哪裡來的，但就這樣吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19166.39, "timestamp": "05:19:26", "text": "我不能。這個怎麼樣？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19180.15, "timestamp": "05:19:40", "text": "我該如何處理這個？  哪個？  我把這件事交給你決定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19181.75, "timestamp": "05:19:41", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19184.15, "timestamp": "05:19:44", "text": "等等。  呃，還有胸部。  哦，我需要一些大件物品。  ["}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19190.708, "timestamp": "05:19:50", "text": "音樂] 是啊。你好"}]